CommitDate: Thu Nov 5 12:04:20 2026 +0800

    fix(collaboration): keep cross-workspace actions visible and recoverable
    
    Expose failed context, file and destination reads without losing original
    requests. Keep recipient choices tied to the current search, reveal opened
    workflow forms, and clarify loaded lists, field errors and localized history.
    Compact the narrow header while preserving the established shared UI.
    
    Constraint: Preserve protected query authority and exact original-request recovery
    Rejected: Replace the collaboration UI | Existing business model and visual identity are coherent
    Confidence: high
    Scope-risk: moderate
    Directive: Keep stale recipient rows nonselectable and retained recovery visible through disclosures
    Tested: 312 Views tests; Views/Web/Desktop types; lint; production build; 54 browser captures; independent review
    Not-tested: Installed Electron Main, real AI providers, physical touch and spoken assistive technology

